[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656415521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102793#issuecomment-2656415521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102793","id":2656415521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eVa8h","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T12:12:59Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T00:25:48Z","body":"> CustomNode's `prop` points to Node2. The `Test` node tries to duplicate CustomNode, but `prop` remains null. The error \"failed to duplicate\" is output to the console.\n\nYour code is:\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\n@onready var custom_node: CustomNode = $CustomNode\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar d := custom_node.duplicate()\n\tif d.prop != custom_node.prop:\n\t\tprint(\"failed to duplicate prop\")\n```\n\nSo you're not checking if `d.prop == null` as you claim, you're checking whether `d.prop != custom_node.prop`. And these are indeed different as `d.prop` references the newly created (grand)child of `d`.\n\n---\n\nAfter changing the script to:\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\n@onready var custom_node: CustomNode = $CustomNode\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar d := custom_node.duplicate()\n\tprint(\"%-20s %-30s %s\" % [\"custom_node.prop\", custom_node.prop, custom_node.get_path_to(custom_node.prop)])\n\tprint(\"%-20s %-30s %s\" % [\"d.prop\", d.prop, d.get_path_to(d.prop)])\n```\nIn v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8] and v4.4.beta3.official [06acfccf8] it outputs:\n```\ncustom_node.prop     Node2:<Node#24981275907>       Node/Node2\nd.prop               Node2:<Node#25081939209>       Node/Node2\n```\nwhich works as intended.\n\nIn v4.2.2.stable.official [15073afe3] the duplicated node indeed references the original node:\n```\ncustom_node.prop     Node2:<Node#24092083395>       Node/Node2\nd.prop               Node2:<Node#24092083395>\n```\n```\nE 0:00:01:0644   test.gd:9 @ _ready(): Parameter \"common_parent\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>   scene/main/node.cpp:2019 @ get_path_to()\n  <Stack Trace>  test.gd:9 @ _ready()\n```\nbut this was considered to be a bug (#82670), and was fixed in 4.3.\n\nSo I don't see a bug in here. Closing as not a bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656415521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660262419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102793#issuecomment-2660262419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102793","id":2660262419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ekGIT","user":{"login":"MikeFP","id":9321233,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMjEyMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9321233?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T21:01:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T21:01:41Z","body":"Whoops, my bad. I went too deep trying to find the minimal configuration that caused the problem.\n\nI fixed that line and found out the exported variable must point to a custom script type for the issue to happen. I updated the attached MRP project accordingly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660262419/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660561570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102793#issuecomment-2660561570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102793","id":2660561570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6elPKi","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T00:21:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T00:21:22Z","body":"With the updated MRP:\n\nCan't reproduce in:\n- v4.2.2.stable.official [15073afe3]\n- v4.3.dev6.official [89850d553]\n\nCan reproduce in:\n- v4.3.beta1.official [a4f2ea91a]\n- v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n- v4.4.beta3.official [06acfccf8]","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660561570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677154621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102793#issuecomment-2677154621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102793","id":2677154621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fkiM9","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith