nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T12:23:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T12:23:34Z","body":"I currently don’t have a lot of time to look into this unfortunately (work, thesis etc). If someone else can then that would be sweet.\n\nTyped dictionaries aren’t handled the same way as  typed arrays and node variables when duplicating. If they work correctly when duplicating then it should be worth looking into changing typed arrays and node variables to behave the same way.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678264713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]